# A vendored-looking C library whose package (third_party/native_reach_no_row)
# has no THIRD_PARTY_OWNERS row (tools/build/one_definition/libraries.bzl):
# the native-reach check must refuse any library linking it
# (tests//negative/native_reach:archive_no_row).
